From 297ad8dde26e02ca32d6becd60d654c1fd67ecd0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: vince <vincepaul.liem@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 12:15:13 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] feat(launch): grow memory files within a shared allocation
 bound

Back writable file bytes with anonymous supervisor mappings, bounded by
the configured memory size. Preserve contents and offsets on exhaustion,
zero sparse/regrown ranges, and release pages at truncate/final close.
Keep existing object and descriptor limits.

Signed-off-by: vince <vincepaul.liem@gmail.com>
